{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36611","headline":"广陵开元寺阁上作 · 罗隐","name":"广陵开元寺阁上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满槛山川漾落晖，槛前前事去如飞。\n云中鸡犬刘安过，月里笙歌炀帝归。\n江蹙海门帆散去，地吞淮口树相依。\n红楼翠幕知多少，长向东风有是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}